    "InternalName": "TruePing",
    "Punchline": "Your real FFXIV ping: the latency you actually feel, with jitter and loss.",
    "Description": "Measures your true FFXIV ping by timing the game's own keepalive round-trip (the latency the server actually answers), not the OS network latency. Because it reads the game protocol, it reports the real latency you feel even when you route through a proxy or VPN, where ordinary ping tools only see localhost. Shows current ping, average, min, max, jitter and packet loss, in a floating overlay and in the server info bar.\n\nCommands:\n/trueping : open the settings window\n/trueping overlay : toggle the floating overlay\n/trueping dtr : toggle the server info bar entry\n/trueping reset : clear the statistics",
